<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  User-visible strings.

  Migration is in progress and deliberately partial: this file holds the strings
  for the screens reworked in the current pass, plus the shared accessibility
  labels, which are the ones most worth centralising (they are easy to get
  inconsistent and invisible in review). Screens not yet migrated still hold
  their copy inline; moving all of them is mechanical work with real regression
  risk and no user-visible benefit until localisation is actually planned.

  Conventions
  - Named by screen or component, then by role: <screen>_<role>.
  - Accessibility labels are suffixed _a11y and describe the *action*, not the
    icon ("Go back", never "Left arrow").
  - Parameterised strings use positional %1$s / %1$d with explicit indices, so a
    translation can reorder them.
-->
